"If an item's recipe was changed at some point (e.g., the ",["l","骷髅火炬","Skull Brazier"],"), the Deconstructor will return the highest value item based on the current recipe - it will not look back to see the materials originally used, even if the particular item was crafted before the recipe change."]],[2,["However, regardless of whether the player has ",["l","钓鱼#Fishing Skill","Trapper profession"],", ",["l","蟹笼","Crab Pot"]," would be deconstructed into 2 ",["l","铜锭","Copper Bars"],"."]],[1,[["l","雨水图腾","Rain Totem"],"s obtained from treasure rooms in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," can be deconstructed into ",["l","松露油","Truffle Oil"]," to greatly increase the sell price from 20g to 1,065g, or 1,491g with the ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Artisan Profession"],"."]],[1,["The ",["l","文字标牌","Text Sign"]," Pam places at the ",["l","巴士站","Bus Stop"]," on days she is unavailable can be collected and deconstructed into 25 ",["l","木材","Wood"],"."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": ",["l","鼓块","Drum Block"]," now produces ",["l","石头","stone"]," and ",["l","长笛块","Flute Block"]," now produces ",["l","木材","wood"]," rather than ",["l","纤维","fiber"],"."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","齐先生的核桃房","Qi's Walnut Room"]," for 20 Qi Gems"]],["Sell Price",["Cannot Be Sold"]]]}